{"id":"n4-046","title":"Verb てみる (〜te miru)","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Used to express 'try to' or 'attempt to do'.","longExplanation":"The ～てみる grammar point is used with verbs to express 'trying' or 'attempting' to do something. It emphasizes the idea of giving something a go or trying it out, often to see what the results or outcome will be.","formation":"Verb-て form + みる","examples":[{"jp":"この料理を作ってみます。","romaji":"Kono ryouri o tsukutte mimasu.","en":"I will try to make this dish.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作っ","vocabId":"1597890","reading":"つくる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"み","vocabId":"1365520","reading":"み"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"その服を着てみてください。","romaji":"Sono fuku o kite mite kudasai.","en":"Please try on those clothes.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"服","vocabId":"1500940","reading":"ふく"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"着","vocabId":"1597470","reading":"ちゃく"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"み","vocabId":"1365520","reading":"み"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"新しいレストランに行ってみよう。","romaji":"Atarashii resutoran ni itte miyou.","en":"Let's try going to the new restaurant.","words":[{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"レストラン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行っ","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みよ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"映画を見てみたいです。","romaji":"Eiga o mite mitai desu.","en":"I want to try watching the movie.","words":[{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"